      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatshia butuku, bakuidi banene ne bakulu ne bafundi ne balumbuludi bonso bakasangisha dî diabo, bakasuika Yesu, bakaya nʼandi, bakamufila mu bianza bia Pilato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato wakamukonka ne, Wewe udi Mukelenge wa Bena Yuda, anyi? Yesu wakamuambila ne, Bûdi wamba mbulelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuidi banene bakamubanda malu a bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato wakamukonka kabidi ne, Kuena witaba di? Unvua mudibo bakubanda malu a bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yesu kakitaba kabidi dî dikuabo; Pilato wakakema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu disanka dia Kuhita kua Yehowa Pilato wakadi ne tshilele tshia kulekelela bantu muena lukanu umue wakalombabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakadi mu nsubu wa lukanu, dina diandi Balaba, musuika ne batomboke nʼandi; mu batomboki buabo bakadi bashihangane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu ba bungi bakaya kudi Pilato, bakamuambila ne, Utuenzele bu mudi tshilele tshiebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato wakabakonka ne, Nudi basue meme nulekelele Mukelenge wa Bena Yuda, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamanya ne, Bakuidi banene bakumufila bualu bua mukau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bakuidi banene bakenzesha tshisumbu tshia bantu ne, Utulekelele Balaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato wakabakonka kabidi ne, Nengenzele unudi nubikila ne, Mukelenge wa Bena Yuda, tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakela mbila kabidi ne, Umushihe ku mutshi mutshiamakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato wakabakonka ne, Kadi wakenza bubi kai? Bobo bakatamba kuela mbila ne, Umushihe ku mutshi mutshiamakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato wakasua kuenzela tshisumbu tshia bantu biakane, wakabalekelela Balaba; hakakumeye Yesu, wakamufila bua kumushihabo ku mutshi mutshiamakane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masalayi akaya ne Yesu mu luhangu—luolo luakadi nsubu manene wa mukelenge; akabikilangana tshisumbu tshiau tshionso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamuluatshisha tshikowelu tshikunze; hakalukau tshifulu tshia meba tshia bukelenge, akamuasatshi ku mutu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabanga kumunemekela ne, Muoyo, Mukelenge wa Bena Yuda! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamukuma ne mulangala ku mutu, akamutuila lute, akatua binu hanshi, akamukukuila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashikishau kumuseka, akamuvula tshikowelu tshikunze, akamuluatshisha bilulu biandi. Akaya nʼandi bua kumushiha ku mutshi mutshiamakane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu dina diandi Simona, Muena Kulene, tatu wa Alesandelo ne Lufo, wakadi ufuma ku mpata; hakasangileye nʼabo, masalayi akamuenzesha ku bukole bua kuyeye nʼabo, mutuale mutshi mutshiamakane wa Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalua nʼandi ku muaba, dina diau Gologota, kukudimuna kua muaku ne, Muaba wa Kabalubalu ka mutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamuha nvinyo musangisha ne mula; kadi yeye wakabenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamukumina milonda mu bianza ne makasa ku mutshi mutshiamakane; bakabanyangana bilulu biandi, bakabielela nshobo bua kumanyabo tshiangata muntu ne muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamukumina milonda ku mutshi mutshiamakane dinda ha tshitema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakafunda bubandi buakamubandabo ha mutu handi ne: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakakumina nʼandi banyengi babidi milonda mu bianza ne ku makasa ku mitshi mitshiamakane, mukuabo ku tshianza tshiandi tshia balume, munga ku tshianza tshiandi tshia bakashi. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Minga mikanda ya hale idi ne mei â:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dî didi bifunda mu Mukanda wa Nzambi diakashikibua ne, Bakamubala hohamue ne bantu babi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahitshi ba mu nshila bakamuhenda, bakakuha mitu yabo, bakamba ne, Ka kia! Wewe muhudi wa ntempelo ne mumuibaki wa matuku asatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "udisungile, utuluke ku mutshi mutshiamakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuidi banene ne bafundi bakamuseka nunku kabidi, bakamba ne, Yeye wakadi usungila bakuabo, kena mumanye mua kudisungila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilisto, Mukelenge wa Isalele, atuluke biandi ku mutshi mutshiamakane, bua tuetu tumone, tumuitabushe. Bakadi nʼandi ha mitshi mitshiamakane bakamuhenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Midima yakadi ha buloba buonso munda munya tô ne diba ha isatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafika diba ha isatu, Yesu wakela dî diandi bikole ne, Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakatani? Kukudimuna kua muaku ne, Nzambi wanyi, Nzambi wanyi, wakundekela tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuabo bakadi bimaneku, hakunvuabo dî edi, bakamba ne, Yeye udi Ubikila Eliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuabo wakaya lukasa, wakûsha musukulampampa tente ne nvinega, wakaubuesha ku mulangala, wakaha Yesu ne, Nua; wakamba ne, Lekela, tumone Eliya ne walua bua kumutulula hanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wakela dî diandi bikole, wakahuola muoyo wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshilulu tshiakadi tshikudika mu ntempelo tshiakahandika bihesa bibidi ku mutu kuatshi tô ne kunshi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kapitene ka masalayi lukama wakadi wimana ha buihi ne Yesu; hakamoneye ne, Yesu wakuhuola muoyo, wakamba ne, Bulelela, muntu eu wakadi Muana wa Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakashi bakadiku kabidi, batangidile ha bule; munkatshi mua bakashi aba muakadi Malia wa ku Magadala, ne Malia mamu wa Yakobo mukese ne wa Yose, ne Salome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadiye mu Galela, bakashi aba bakadi bamulonda, bamukuatshisha; bakashi bakuabo ba bungi bakadiku, bakabanda nʼandi ku Yelushalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamba diba kubuela, bualu bua dituku adi diakadi Dilongolola, diakadi ku nyima kua Lumingu lua Bayuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wa ku Alimataya wakalua; yeye wakadi mulumbuludi wa butumbi, wakadi mutekemene bukelenge bua Nzambi; wakaya kudi Pilato ne dikima mu mutshima, wakamulomba tshitalu tshia Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato wakakema ne, Ukadi mufue katataka; wakabikila kapitene ka masalayi lukama, wakamukonka ne, Ukadi mufue musangu mule, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamumanyisha kapitene ka masalayi bualu abu, yeye wakafila tshitalu kudi Yosefe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakasumba tshilulu tshia line; hakamutululeye hanshi, wakamujingila tshilulu, wakamuladika mu lukita lumbula mu dibue; wakabunguluisha dibue dinene, wakadijibika ku mushiku wa mbelu wa lukita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malia wa ku Magadala ne Malia mamu wa Yose bakamona hakamuladikabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
